#! seed 1861
# Civil War Strategy: three games in one run, each to another ending (QB64Rust's tools/screen/
# README.md, "Places and rules"). After Game Over the game starts again at its title menu. Each game sets its end
# conditions in the Utility menu (End Cond, which starts on Time and toggles the row it is on), then END TURN by
# rules: game 1 with only the income condition: in July 1863 the Rebels hold 80 % of the income; game 2 with only
# the capital, the enemy made passive (Aggress three times): in March 1870 the Rebels take Washington; game 3 with
# only the time, the enemy as configured: the Union is annihilated before the time runs out, which ends the game
# without the Options menu. Each game's end: the Hall of Fame and a name, Game Over. At the end, Quit.

# The waits of the computer's turns: a space each; a Retreat menu: the city it starts on; a main menu: END TURN;
# the End Turn and End Game menus: Yes. The Options at an end are answered by steps.
rule 1:R key space
rule 1:P key space
rule 1:B key space
rule 1:U key space
rule 1:K key space
rule 1:I key space
rule 1:N key space
rule 1:S key space
rule 1:H key space
rule 1:G key space
rule 1:F key space
rule 1:L key space
rule 2:M text e
rule 2:E text y
rule 2:R key enter
# Game 1. The title menu: Start NEW Game; the main menu: UTILITY, End Cond: Time, Cities, Capital and Force Ratio off.
play until 2:V
digest
text s
# The scenario menu: the Standard Map.
play until 2:S
text s
play until 2:M
digest
text u
prompt
text e
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key esc
prompt
key esc
# July 1863, the income: the Options: Quit; the Hall of Fame: a name.
play until 2:O
state
text q
play until 4
text Grant
key enter
# Game 2. Start NEW Game; UTILITY, Aggress three times, End Cond: Time, Cities, Income and Force Ratio off.
play until 2:V
digest
text s
# The scenario menu: the Standard Map.
play until 2:S
text s
play until 2:M
digest
text u
prompt
text a
prompt
text a
prompt
text a
prompt
text e
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key esc
prompt
key esc
# March 1870, Washington taken: the Options: Quit; the Hall of Fame: a name.
play until 2:O
state
text q
play until 4
text Grant
key enter
# Game 3. Start NEW Game; UTILITY, End Cond: Cities, Income, Capital and Force Ratio off.
play until 2:V
digest
text s
# The scenario menu: the Standard Map.
play until 2:S
text s
play until 2:M
digest
text u
prompt
text e
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key esc
prompt
key esc
# The Union annihilated: the Hall of Fame: a name; Game Over; the title menu: Quit; END's key.
play until 4
state
text Grant
key enter
play until 2:V
state
text q
repeat space
